  "_doc": "Canonical RCx preset registry. Ids are Open-FDD's; aliases hold old downstream ids. series[]: a selector is {role} (an fdd-catalog.json role, bound by NF class = score 2, else marker set = score 1) or {markers, any_of, exclude}; required = the preset needs it on an equip; use = how a renderer draws it (primary, overlay, return, x, gate, signal); axis = expected axis (the spec's own axis comes from the resolved unit); multiple = every matching point, not just the best. fault_rules = rules whose fault strips accompany the plot. skip_equip_if_bound = the equip is left out when a preferred role is bound. derived = values a renderer computes from the series. chart = renderer hint. Generated once from nf-app/static/rcx-presets.js, rcx-overview.js and fdd-plots.js; this file is now the source of truth.",
